# The contract this portal is generated against.
#
# The OPERATOR contract, not the traveller one. Different document, different
# base path, different auth, and a tenant boundary the traveller API does not
# have: `operator_id` is read from the session row and is never accepted as a
# parameter in any position.
#
# The intent is that both frontends pin one yuvoy-api commit, so they cannot be
# reasoning about different versions of the same backend. They agree today:
# `yuvoy-app` is on this same ref. The two documents are separate files, so a
# change to one says nothing about the other — this bump touches only the
# operator document, and yuvoy-app's bump to the same ref touched only the
# traveller one.
#
# `pnpm contract:check` fails the build if this copy stops matching the ref.
